 "whole_render": {
  "text": "or the king of the four year cycle zombies. Benjamin Cowan was absolutely perplexed about how Bitcoin went above the May high. And I'm like, dude, people are front running the October bottom because they realize that the bottom is in. That's it. That doesn't, you just can't figure that out by looking at a chart. I feel like I felt illuminated when I realized, when I came to the conclusion, there's no such thing as a four year cycle. I just feel illuminated. It was like absolutely illuminated.",
